  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: heap out-of-bounds read and NUL write in Proxy\n     Protocol v1 header parsing\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-94054.patch: size the heap copy of the\n       received PROXY v1 line by its string length instead of by the\n       number of bytes read, so the search for the terminating CR and the\n       NUL written there stay inside the copy\n     - CVE-2026-94054",
